  "implementation_decisions": [
    "Persist provider, point_type_id and opaque point_id together; a bare number is not identity.",
    "Collapse only fully identical duplicate records; reject conflicting records rather than selecting silently.",
    "Use provider-declared WGS84/LV95 coordinate columns and catalogue height_masl provenance.",
    "The generic Point of Interest category does not provide a per-record summit/pass/hut subtype.",
    "Missing heights in future snapshots must remain unknown; zero is not a default.",
    "Keep forecast location, observation station, warning postcode and pollen station independent."
  ],
